# SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
@prefix ens:   <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> .
@prefix era:   <http://data.europa.eu/949/> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos:  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix time:  <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .
@prefix geo:   <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#> .
@prefix prov:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix dct:   <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix sosa:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
@prefix saref: <https://saref.etsi.org/core/> .
@prefix unit:  <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix qudt:  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/> .
@prefix ssn:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
@prefix enssh: <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/shapes/> .
@prefix vann:  <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/> .
@prefix vs:    <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#> .

# =====================================================================
# DRAFT v0.9 – ERA ontology extension for traction energy settlement
#   (proposal for ERA governance; namespace http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/)
# LOT activity: Ontology implementation (conceptualisation + reuse),
#   validated against the 53 competency questions executed by cq_suite.py
#   (report: era-energy-settlement-cqs.md).
#
# Baseline: ERA ontology v4.0.0-rc.3 (vendored). No owl:imports, following
#   rc.3. Reused classes and properties are declared, with their source
#   labels, in Part 3 at the end of this file.
#
# Sources: ERA study AS-03 (2026); TEL TSI (EU) 2026/253 Annex 2.5.1(16)
#   and 2.5.2(8); ENE TSI Art. 9(4); EN 50463:2017 and prEN revision;
#   UIC IRS 90930; Eress guidelines.
#
# Changes from v0.8:
#   - The EMS, the data handling system, the data collecting system, the
#     exchange function and the settlement system are ssn:System (R11).
#     The data handling system used sosa:System, which W3C SOSA/SSN does
#     not define (R26). No prov:Agent superclass is stated: agency stays
#     an inference from ens:compiledBy and ens:producedBy.
#   - ens:RunningTrain is no longer a subclass of era:Train (R19): ERA's TAP
#     shape for era:Train requires era:trainNb. A running train is
#     identified by ens:runningTrainNumberIdentifier (the shared
#     era:OperationalTrainNumberIdentifier) and ens:departureDate.
#   - Part 3 declares every reused class (ERA, SOSA/SSN, PROV-O, OWL-Time,
#     GeoSPARQL, QUDT, SAREF, SKOS) as owl:Class with its source label.
#
# Changes from v0.7 (v0.8):
#   - One party pattern (R10): every party-valued ens: property targets
#     era:OrganisationRole; the role reaches its era:Body through
#     era:roleOf and its kind through era:hasOrganisationRole.
#     ens:exchangeSender and ens:exchangeRecipient now target roles (the
#     receiving system stays linked by ens:exchangeContains);
#     ens:responsibleRUOrganisation is replaced by
#     ens:responsibleRailwayUndertaking; ens:operatedBy has a domain.
#
# Changes from v0.6 (v0.7):
#   - Licence: EUPL v1.2 (Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2017/863),
#     the licence of the ERA ontology.
#   - Maximal SOSA/SSN reuse. An energy reading is a sosa:ObservationCollection
#     (SSN-Ext) whose members are sosa:Observation instances, one per
#     observable property (ens:ConsumedActiveEnergy,
#     ens:RegeneratedActiveEnergy, ens:MeasuredReactiveEnergy), each with a
#     sosa:hasResult qudt:QuantityValue. A CEBD is a collection of readings.
#     Shared values sit on the collection (sosa:hasFeatureOfInterest,
#     sosa:phenomenonTime); sosa:madeBySensor is on each member observation.
#   - SOSA properties used directly; their ens: aliases are deprecated
#     (ens:readingOfConsumptionPoint, ens:measuredBy, ens:readingPeriod,
#     ens:hasReading, ens:installedOn, ens:hasMeasurementFunction,
#     ens:hasDataHandlingSystem).
#   - ens:activeEnergyConsumed, ens:activeEnergyRegenerated and
#     ens:reactiveEnergy are shortcuts derived from the member
#     observations by a SHACL rule; they are not asserted in source data.
#
# Changes from v0.5 (v0.6):
#   - Namespace moved from example.org to http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/
#     (prefixes ens: vocabulary, ensc: concepts, enssh: shapes).
#   - Ontology metadata: title, description, versionIRI, preferred prefix,
#     term status. Every ens: term has rdfs:label, rdfs:isDefinedBy and
#     vs:term_status "unstable".
#   - ens:TrainRun renamed ens:RunningTrain (cf. era:RunningTrack) and made
#     a subclass of era:Train; era:operationalTrainNumber replaces
#     ens:operationalTrainNumber. It can carry the TAF/TAP unique train
#     identification (era:TrainIdent) through ens:runningTrainIdent.
#     Related properties renamed: ens:aboutRunningTrain,
#     ens:matchedRunningTrain. ens:runningTrainId removed: a running train
#     is keyed by era:operationalTrainNumber + era:trainDepartureDate.
#   - New ens:operatingRailwayUndertaking -> era:OrganisationRole with the
#     ERA RU role concept; era:trainOperatingRU keeps the source code.
#   - ens:railwayCompanyCode deprecated in favour of era:organisationCode.
#   - No SKOS mapping properties on classes or properties: skos:closeMatch
#     to saref:Measurement replaced by rdfs:seeAlso.
#   - ens:allocatesReading is entailed from allocation components by an
#     OWL 2 property chain.
#   - ens:forwardsTo and ens:exchangeProtocol received domains and ranges.
#
# Changes from v0.4 (v0.5): allocation components and quantities, stable
#   train-run identity (ens:TrainRun reintroduced: the rc.3 messages carry
#   operational numbers, which are reused and are not run keys), exchange
#   evidence, normalized EVN rules, actual-departure/timeliness evidence.
#
# Changes from v0.2 (driven by rc.3): Part 2 rebuilt on the rc.3 telematics
#   module; era:borderPointOf (deprecated) replaced by
#   era:referenceBorderPoint; EVN as era:vehicleNumber; contact line via
#   era:RunningTrack; units via era:unitOfMeasure with QUDT;
#   ens:SettlementZone specialises era:Feature.
#
# SHACL constraints are in era-energy-settlement-shapes.ttl. They validate
# identity normalization, allocation quantities, measurement intervals,
# run/message matching, and exchange evidence. They do not certify legal
# compliance or infer that a legal basis authorizes a particular disclosure.
# =====================================================================

<http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "ERA energy settlement extension (draft)"@en ;
    dct:title "ERA energy settlement extension"@en ;
    dct:description "Proposed extension of the ERA ontology for on-board traction energy measurement, energy data exchange and settlement allocation, linked to ERA telematics (TEL TSI) and RINF concepts."@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/0.9.0> ;
    owl:versionInfo "0.9.0" ;
    owl:priorVersion <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/0.8.0> ;
    dct:license <http://data.europa.eu/eli/dec_impl/2017/863/oj> ;
    dct:created "2026-10-15"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:modified "2026-10-25"^^xsd:date ;
    vann:preferredNamespacePrefix "ens" ;
    vann:preferredNamespaceUri "http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/" ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://gitlab.com/era-europa-eu/public/interoperable-data-programme/era-ontology/era-ontology/-/tree/v4.0.0-rc.3> .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# PART 1 – Energy settlement module (no equivalent in rc.3)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

## 1.1 On-board measurement (EN 50463 / LOC&PAS TSI 4.2.8.2.8)

ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf saref:Meter , sosa:Platform , ssn:System ;
    rdfs:label "Energy measurement system (EMS)"@en ;
    skos:definition "On-board system measuring energy taken from and returned to the contact line, compiling CEBD and transmitting it to a DCS (EN 50463)."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Instance-level counterpart of the vehicle type parameter era:hasOnboardEnergyMeasurement (ERATV 4.10.12)."@en .

ens:EnergyMeasurementFunction a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf sosa:Sensor ;
    rdfs:label "Energy measurement function (EMF)"@en ;
    skos:definition "Function measuring voltage and current and calculating energy (EN 50463-2)."@en .

ens:DataHandlingSystem a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ssn:System ;
    rdfs:label "Data handling system (DHS)"@en ;
    skos:definition "Function merging EMF data with time and position to compile, store and send CEBD (EN 50463-3)."@en .

ens:ConsumptionPoint a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf sosa:FeatureOfInterest ;
    rdfs:label "Consumption point"@en ;
    skos:definition "Billing point to which measured traction energy is attributed, distinct from the EMS hardware (prEN 50463 revision). Under TEL TSI Annex 2.5.1(16) its identifier is the EVN of the traction unit."@en .

ens:CompiledEnergyBillingData a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity , sosa:ObservationCollection ;
    rdfs:label "Compiled energy billing data (CEBD)"@en ;
    skos:definition "Data set compiled by the DHS, suitable for energy billing (EN 50463)."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A collection (SSN-Ext) whose sosa:hasMember values are the energy readings it contains."@en .

ens:EnergyReading a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf sosa:ObservationCollection , geo:Feature ;
    rdfs:seeAlso saref:Measurement ;
    rdfs:label "Energy reading"@en ;
    skos:definition "Energy values of one consumption point for one measurement period, time-stamped and geolocated, as compiled in a CEBD record."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An SSN-Ext observation collection. Its members are sosa:Observation instances, one per observable property (ens:ConsumedActiveEnergy, ens:RegeneratedActiveEnergy, ens:MeasuredReactiveEnergy), each with a sosa:hasResult qudt:QuantityValue. Values shared by all members are stated once on the collection: sosa:hasFeatureOfInterest (the consumption point) and sosa:phenomenonTime (the measurement period). sosa:madeBySensor (the EMF) is stated on each member: under the SSN axioms every sosa:Sensor only makes sosa:Observation, so a collection linked to its sensor would be inferred to be an observation. The GPS fix is the collection's geo:hasGeometry. saref:Measurement is only referenced: it describes a single value. Not an era:Feature: readings are measurement data, not network features with validity."@en .

ens:ReadingBlock a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ens:EnergyReading ;
    rdfs:label "Reading block"@en ;
    skos:definition "Higher-granularity reading (e.g. one minute) accepted in exchange and settlement by Erex."@en .

ens:installedOn a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "installed on"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "deprecated" ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy sosa:isHostedBy ;
    rdfs:comment "Deprecated in v0.7: use sosa:isHostedBy directly; the domain and range are enforced in SHACL."@en ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf sosa:isHostedBy ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem ;
    rdfs:range era:Vehicle ;
    rdfs:comment "Via sosa:isHostedBy, a vehicle carrying an EMS is inferred to be a sosa:Platform. This is an inference on instances; era:Vehicle itself is not modified."@en .

ens:hasMeasurementFunction a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "has measurement function"@en ;
    skos:definition "Energy measurement function hosted by the energy measurement system."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "deprecated" ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy sosa:hosts ;
    rdfs:comment "Deprecated in v0.7: use sosa:hosts directly; the domain and range are enforced in SHACL."@en ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf sosa:hosts ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem ;
    rdfs:range ens:EnergyMeasurementFunction .

ens:hasDataHandlingSystem a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "has data handling system"@en ;
    skos:definition "Data handling system hosted by the energy measurement system."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "deprecated" ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy sosa:hosts ;
    rdfs:comment "Deprecated in v0.7: use sosa:hosts directly; the domain and range are enforced in SHACL."@en ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf sosa:hosts ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem ;
    rdfs:range ens:DataHandlingSystem .

ens:measuresConsumptionPoint a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "measures consumption point"@en ;
    skos:definition "Consumption point to which the energy measured by this EMS is attributed."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem ;
    rdfs:range ens:ConsumptionPoint .

ens:consumptionPointOf a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "consumption point of"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule enssh:ConsumptionPointShape ;
    rdfs:domain ens:ConsumptionPoint ;
    rdfs:range era:Vehicle ;
    rdfs:comment "Traction unit identified by the consumption point (TEL TSI 2.5.1(16))."@en .

ens:consumptionPointId a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "consumption point identifier"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule enssh:ConsumptionPointShape ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf dct:identifier ;
    rdfs:domain ens:ConsumptionPoint ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Source identifier as received. Normalize only ASCII spaces and hyphens for EVN comparison; retain this original lexical value."@en .

ens:emsStandardVersion a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "EMS standard version"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem ;
    rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:comment "SKOS scheme: EN 50463:2012, EN 50463:2017, legacy."@en .

ens:compiledBy a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "compiled by"@en ;
    skos:definition "Energy measurement system that compiled the CEBD."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf prov:wasAttributedTo ;
    rdfs:domain ens:CompiledEnergyBillingData ;
    rdfs:range ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem .

ens:hasReading a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "has reading"@en ;
    skos:definition "Energy reading contained in the CEBD."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "deprecated" ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy sosa:hasMember ;
    rdfs:comment "Deprecated in v0.7: use sosa:hasMember directly; the domain and range are enforced in SHACL."@en ;
    rdfs:domain ens:CompiledEnergyBillingData ;
    rdfs:range ens:EnergyReading .

ens:readingOfConsumptionPoint a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "reading of consumption point"@en ;
    skos:definition "Consumption point to which the reading refers."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "deprecated" ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy sosa:hasFeatureOfInterest ;
    rdfs:comment "Deprecated in v0.7: use sosa:hasFeatureOfInterest directly; the domain and range are enforced in SHACL."@en ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf sosa:hasFeatureOfInterest ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyReading ;
    rdfs:range ens:ConsumptionPoint .

ens:measuredBy a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "measured by"@en ;
    skos:definition "Energy measurement function that produced the reading."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "deprecated" ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy sosa:madeBySensor ;
    rdfs:comment "Deprecated in v0.7: use sosa:madeBySensor directly, on each member observation of a reading; the domain and range are enforced in SHACL."@en ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf sosa:madeBySensor ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyReading ;
    rdfs:range ens:EnergyMeasurementFunction .

ens:readingPeriod a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "reading period"@en ;
    skos:definition "Measurement period of the reading."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "deprecated" ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy sosa:phenomenonTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Deprecated in v0.7: use sosa:phenomenonTime directly; the domain and range are enforced in SHACL."@en ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf sosa:phenomenonTime ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyReading ;
    rdfs:range time:Interval .
    # position: reuse geo:hasGeometry -> sf:Point (GPS fix)

ens:activeEnergyConsumed a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "active energy consumed"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyReading ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    era:unitOfMeasure unit:KiloW-HR ;
    rdfs:comment "Active energy taken from the contact line in the period. Shortcut derived from the member observation of ens:ConsumedActiveEnergy (enssh:EnergyReadingShape rule); do not assert it in source data."@en .

ens:activeEnergyRegenerated a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "active energy regenerated"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyReading ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    era:unitOfMeasure unit:KiloW-HR ;
    rdfs:comment "Active energy returned to the contact line (regenerative braking). Shortcut derived from the member observation of ens:RegeneratedActiveEnergy (enssh:EnergyReadingShape rule); do not assert it in source data."@en .

ens:reactiveEnergy a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "reactive energy"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyReading ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    era:unitOfMeasure unit:KiloVAR-HR ;
    rdfs:comment "Reactive energy in kilovar-hours (kvarh). Shortcut derived from the member observation of ens:MeasuredReactiveEnergy (enssh:EnergyReadingShape rule); do not assert it in source data."@en .

ens:measurementQuality a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "measurement quality"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyReading ;
    rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:comment "Quality state reported or assigned under the applicable metering and settlement rules; not a certification by this ontology."@en .

ens:measurementEvidence a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "measurement evidence"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem ;
    rdfs:range prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:comment "Evidence reference for the applicable meter approval, calibration, or conformity assessment."@en .

ens:ConsumedActiveEnergy a sosa:ObservableProperty , owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:label "Consumed active energy"@en ;
    skos:definition "Active energy taken from the contact line by the traction unit (EN 50463), observed in kWh."@en .

ens:RegeneratedActiveEnergy a sosa:ObservableProperty , owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:label "Regenerated active energy"@en ;
    skos:definition "Active energy returned to the contact line by regenerative braking (EN 50463), observed in kWh."@en .

ens:MeasuredReactiveEnergy a sosa:ObservableProperty , owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:label "Reactive energy"@en ;
    skos:definition "Reactive energy exchanged with the contact line (EN 50463), observed in kvarh."@en .

## 1.2 Ground systems (ENE TSI 4.2.17, Art. 9(4); IRS 90930)

ens:DataCollectingSystem a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ssn:System ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:label "Data collecting system (DCS)"@en ;
    skos:definition "On-ground system receiving CEBD from EMSs and forwarding it to settlement."@en .

ens:ExchangeFunction a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ssn:System ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:label "Exchange function"@en ;
    skos:definition "Function sorting energy data and allocating it to the correct settlement zone, including cross-border exchange (IRS 90930). Example: Erex."@en .

ens:SettlementSystem a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ssn:System ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:label "Settlement system"@en ;
    skos:definition "On-ground system validating CEBD, estimating missing data and allocating consumption to parties (ENE TSI Art. 9(4))."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Like the data collecting system and the exchange function, an ssn:System. It is a prov:Agent only by inference from ens:producedBy (⊑ prov:wasAttributedTo); no prov:Agent superclass is stated."@en .

ens:SettlementZone a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf era:Feature ;
    rdfs:label "Settlement zone"@en ;
    skos:definition "Geographic and operational area served by one settlement system, delimited by agreed border points and polygons (IRS 90930)."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "As an era:Feature it inherits geo:Feature (polygon via geo:hasGeometry) and era:validity."@en .

ens:receivesFrom a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "receives from"@en ;
    skos:definition "Energy measurement system from which the DCS receives CEBD."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataCollectingSystem ;
    rdfs:range ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem .

ens:forwardsTo a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule enssh:ForwardsToShape ;
    rdfs:label "forwards to"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain [ a owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( ens:DataCollectingSystem ens:ExchangeFunction ) ] ;
    rdfs:range [ a owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( ens:ExchangeFunction ens:SettlementSystem ) ] ;
    rdfs:comment "DCS -> ExchangeFunction, or ExchangeFunction -> SettlementSystem. The admissible pairs are checked in SHACL; the unions only bound the domain and range."@en .

ens:exchangesWith a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:SymmetricProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchanges with"@en ;
    skos:definition "Exchange function with which this exchange function exchanges energy data, e.g. across borders."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:ExchangeFunction ;
    rdfs:range ens:ExchangeFunction .

ens:exchangeProtocol a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchange protocol"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:ExchangeFunction ;
    rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:comment "SKOS scheme: IRS 90930, IRS 90930 via proprietary interface, UTILTS legacy."@en .

ens:servesZone a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "serves zone"@en ;
    skos:definition "Settlement zone served by the settlement system."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:SettlementSystem ;
    rdfs:range ens:SettlementZone .

ens:operatedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "operated by"@en ;
    skos:definition "Organisation role in which a body operates a data collecting system, an exchange function or a settlement system."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain [ a owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( ens:DataCollectingSystem ens:ExchangeFunction ens:SettlementSystem ) ] ;
    rdfs:range era:OrganisationRole .

## 1.3 Roles (IRS 90930) – specialise era:OrganisationRole

ens:EnergyConsumerRole a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf era:OrganisationRole ;
    rdfs:label "Energy consumer"@en ;
    skos:definition "Party to which consumption is allocated, normally the RU operating the train."@en .

ens:EMSResponsibleRole a owl:Class ;
    skos:definition "Role of the party responsible for the on-board energy measurement system, its configuration and its data (IRS 90930)."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf era:OrganisationRole ;
    rdfs:label "EMS responsible"@en .

ens:emsResponsible a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyMeasurementSystem ;
    rdfs:range ens:EMSResponsibleRole ;
    rdfs:label "EMS responsible party"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Added in v0.4: competency question CQ10.3 could not be answered without it."@en .

ens:DCSAdministratorRole a owl:Class ;
    skos:definition "Role of the party administering a data collecting system that receives CEBD from energy measurement systems (IRS 90930)."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf era:OrganisationRole ;
    rdfs:label "DCS administrator"@en .

ens:SettlementOperatorRole a owl:Class ;
    skos:definition "Role of the party operating a settlement system for a settlement zone (IRS 90930)."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf era:OrganisationRole ;
    rdfs:label "Settlement operator"@en .
    # Vehicle keeper: reuse era:vehicleKeeper (era:Vehicle -> era:OrganisationRole)

## 1.4 Settlement outcome

ens:EnergyAllocation a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:label "Energy allocation"@en ;
    skos:definition "Result of allocating validated or estimated energy for a train and zone to a consumer."@en .

ens:AllocationComponent a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:label "Energy allocation component"@en ;
    skos:definition "The part of an allocation attributed to one source reading, or one separately evidenced estimate."@en .

ens:hasAllocationComponent a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "has allocation component"@en ;
    skos:definition "Component of an allocation attributed to one source reading or one evidenced estimate."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range ens:AllocationComponent .

ens:componentReading a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "component reading"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:AllocationComponent ; rdfs:range ens:EnergyReading ;
    rdfs:comment "Source reading for metered allocation components; intentionally absent for estimates without a source reading."@en .

ens:componentActiveEnergyConsumed a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "component active energy consumed"@en ;
    skos:definition "Consumed active energy attributed by this component."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:AllocationComponent ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    era:unitOfMeasure unit:KiloW-HR .

ens:componentActiveEnergyRegenerated a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "component active energy regenerated"@en ;
    skos:definition "Regenerated active energy attributed by this component."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:AllocationComponent ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    era:unitOfMeasure unit:KiloW-HR .

ens:componentNetActiveEnergy a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "component net active energy"@en ;
    skos:definition "Net active energy of this component: component consumed minus component regenerated energy."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:AllocationComponent ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    era:unitOfMeasure unit:KiloW-HR .

ens:allocatesReading a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocates reading"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf prov:wasDerivedFrom ;
    owl:propertyChainAxiom ( ens:hasAllocationComponent ens:componentReading ) ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range ens:EnergyReading ;
    rdfs:comment "Source reading of an allocation. Entailed from the allocation components; asserting it directly is kept for data without a reasoner and must agree with the components."@en .

ens:allocatedTo a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocated to"@en ;
    skos:definition "Energy consumer to which the allocation attributes the energy."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range ens:EnergyConsumerRole .

ens:allocatedInZone a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocated in zone"@en ;
    skos:definition "Settlement zone in which the allocated energy is settled."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range ens:SettlementZone .

ens:allocationStatus a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocation status"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:comment "SKOS scheme: metered-valid, metered-rejected, estimated, fallback-to-keeper."@en .

ens:allocatedActiveEnergyConsumed a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocated active energy consumed"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    era:unitOfMeasure unit:KiloW-HR ;
    rdfs:comment "Consumed active energy attributed by this allocation; distinct from energy merely observed by a source reading."@en .

ens:allocatedActiveEnergyRegenerated a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocated active energy regenerated"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    era:unitOfMeasure unit:KiloW-HR ;
    rdfs:comment "Regenerated active energy attributed by this allocation."@en .

ens:allocatedNetActiveEnergy a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocated net active energy"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    era:unitOfMeasure unit:KiloW-HR ;
    rdfs:comment "Net active energy, defined as allocated consumed minus allocated regenerated energy. Billing treatment is market- and contract-specific."@en .

ens:allocationMethod a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocation method"@en ;
    skos:definition "Method concept used to produce the allocation (e.g. metered, estimated, fallback)."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ;
    rdfs:range skos:Concept .

ens:allocationRule a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocation rule"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ;
    rdfs:range prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:comment "Versioned rule or method document used to produce the allocation."@en .

ens:allocationVersion a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "allocation version"@en ;
    skos:definition "Version identifier of the allocation, distinguishing successive corrections of the same allocation."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range xsd:string .

ens:producedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "produced by"@en ;
    skos:definition "Settlement system that produced the allocation."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf prov:wasAttributedTo ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range ens:SettlementSystem .

ens:RunningTrain a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:label "Running train"@en ;
    skos:definition "A train running a specific service movement on the network, identified independently of its reusable operational train number."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Identified by its operational train number identifier (ens:runningTrainNumberIdentifier) together with its departure date (ens:departureDate); the number alone is not a key, since it is reused on other days. Not a subclass of era:Train since 0.9: ERA's TAP shape for era:Train requires era:trainNb, a train service number that running trains do not carry (R19). Named after era:RunningTrack."@en .

ens:runningTrainNumberIdentifier a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule enssh:RunningTrainShape ;
    rdfs:label "running train number identifier"@en ;
    skos:definition "Operational train number identifier under which this train runs."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:RunningTrain ; rdfs:range era:OperationalTrainNumberIdentifier ;
    rdfs:comment "Points to the same era:OperationalTrainNumberIdentifier node that the TEL TSI messages reference through era:operationalTrainNumberIdentifier, so that messages and running trains share the number; the node carries era:operationalTrainNumber."@en .

ens:departureDate a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule enssh:RunningTrainShape ;
    rdfs:label "departure date"@en ;
    skos:definition "Date on which the train left its origin under its operational train number."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:RunningTrain ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:seeAlso era:trainDepartureDate ;
    rdfs:comment "Same meaning as era:trainDepartureDate, which is not used here because its domain is era:Train: on a running train it would type the running train as an era:Train again."@en .

ens:runningTrainIdent a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:RunningTrain ; rdfs:range era:TrainIdent ;
    rdfs:label "running train identification"@en ;
    skos:definition "TAF/TAP TSI unique identification of the contracted train (era:TrainIdent) under which this train runs."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Preferred production key for a running train where the TAF/TAP identifiers are exchanged. Otherwise the key is the operational train number (ens:runningTrainNumberIdentifier) together with ens:departureDate."@en .

ens:operatingRailwayUndertaking a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule enssh:RunningTrainShape ;
    rdfs:label "operating railway undertaking"@en ;
    skos:definition "Organisation role in which a body operates the running train as railway undertaking."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:RunningTrain ; rdfs:range era:OrganisationRole ;
    rdfs:comment "The role has era:hasOrganisationRole RU (or a narrower RU-n concept of the ERA organisation-roles scheme) and era:roleOf the body that operates the train. The operating RU is not necessarily the energy consumer (see ens:consumerRole). The source company code era:trainOperatingRU is not used on running trains since 0.9: its domain is era:Train."@en .

ens:runStart a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "run start"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:RunningTrain ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Start of the interval within which messages and readings may be attributed to the run; not the actual departure (see ens:actualDepartureTime)."@en .

ens:runEnd a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "run end"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:RunningTrain ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "End of the interval within which messages and readings may be attributed to the run."@en .

ens:consumerRole a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "consumer role"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:RunningTrain ; rdfs:range ens:EnergyConsumerRole ;
    rdfs:comment "Consumer party applicable to this run under the relevant agreement and allocation rules."@en .

ens:responsibleRailwayUndertaking a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule enssh:RunningMessageShape ;
    rdfs:label "responsible railway undertaking"@en ;
    skos:definition "Organisation role in which a body is the railway undertaking responsible for the train reported by a running information message."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain era:TrainRunningInformationMessage ;
    rdfs:range era:OrganisationRole ;
    rdfs:comment "Object counterpart of the era:responsibleRU company code, which is kept as supplied. The role has era:hasOrganisationRole RU (or a narrower RU-n concept) and era:roleOf the body whose era:organisationCode equals the source code, as for ens:operatingRailwayUndertaking."@en .

ens:responsibleRUOrganisation a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "responsible RU organisation"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "deprecated" ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy ens:responsibleRailwayUndertaking ;
    rdfs:domain era:TrainRunningInformationMessage ;
    rdfs:range era:Body ;
    rdfs:comment "Deprecated in v0.8: party-valued properties target era:OrganisationRole (R10); use ens:responsibleRailwayUndertaking."@en .

ens:railwayCompanyCode a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "railway company code"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "deprecated" ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy era:organisationCode ;
    rdfs:domain era:Body ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Deprecated in v0.6: use era:organisationCode, the code allocated by ERA to a body, which the telematics company codes (era:trainOperatingRU, era:responsibleRU) refer to."@en .

ens:aboutRunningTrain a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "about running train"@en ;
    skos:definition "Running train described by a telematics composition or running information message."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain [ a owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( era:TrainCompositionMessage era:TrainRunningInformationMessage ) ] ;
    rdfs:range ens:RunningTrain .

ens:matchedRunningTrain a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "matched running train"@en ;
    skos:definition "Running train to which the allocated energy is attributed."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ; rdfs:range ens:RunningTrain .

ens:actualDepartureTime a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "actual departure time"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:RunningTrain ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Actual departure time only when supported by an authoritative operational event; do not substitute the booked time."@en .

ens:actualDepartureEvidence a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "actual departure evidence"@en ;
    skos:definition "Evidence record (e.g. operational event or message) supporting the actual departure time of the run."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:RunningTrain ; rdfs:range prov:Entity .

ens:timelinessAssessment a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "timeliness assessment"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain era:TrainCompositionMessage ; rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:comment "A documented assessment under the applicable telematics rule; this property does not itself establish that an exception is legally valid."@en .

ens:timelinessEvidence a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "timeliness evidence"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain era:TrainCompositionMessage ; rdfs:range prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:comment "Evidence supporting a late-message exception assessment."@en .

ens:timelinessAuthority a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "timeliness authority"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain era:TrainCompositionMessage ; rdfs:range prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:comment "Reference to the verified legal rule or agreement used to assess composition-message timeliness."@en .

ens:DataExchangeActivity a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf prov:Activity ;
    rdfs:label "Data exchange activity"@en ;
    skos:definition "Auditable record of a message disclosure to a specific recipient."@en .

ens:exchangedMessage a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchanged message"@en ;
    skos:definition "Message or CEBD whose specific version was exchanged."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ;
    rdfs:range [ a owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( era:TrainCompositionMessage era:TrainRunningInformationMessage ens:CompiledEnergyBillingData ) ] .

ens:exchangeRecipient a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchange recipient"@en ;
    skos:definition "Organisation role in which a body receives the exchanged message, typically the settlement operator."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ; rdfs:range era:OrganisationRole ;
    rdfs:comment "The receiving party, not the receiving system: the settlement system that received the exchange is linked by ens:exchangeContains and must be operated (ens:operatedBy) by this role. Changed in v0.8 from a settlement system range (R10)."@en .

ens:exchangeSender a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchange sender"@en ;
    skos:definition "Organisation role in which a body sends the exchanged message, for example an infrastructure manager."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ; rdfs:range era:OrganisationRole ;
    rdfs:comment "Changed in v0.8 from an era:Body range (R10): the sender is the role the body acts in, reached through era:roleOf."@en .

ens:exchangeTime a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchange time"@en ;
    skos:definition "Time at which the exchange took place."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .

ens:messageVersion a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "message version"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Sender-supplied version or sequence identifier for the exact message payload exchanged."@en .

ens:exchangedPayloadDigest a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchanged payload digest"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional cryptographic digest of the exchanged payload, when supported by the transport and evidence policy."@en .

ens:exchangeOutcome a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchange outcome"@en ;
    skos:definition "Outcome of the exchange (e.g. delivered, acknowledged, rejected)."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ; rdfs:range skos:Concept .

ens:exchangePurpose a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchange purpose"@en ;
    skos:definition "Declared purpose of the exchange (e.g. energy settlement)."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ; rdfs:range skos:Concept .

ens:exchangeAuthority a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchange authority"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ; rdfs:range prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:comment "Reference to the specific applicable legal provision, agreement, or other documented authority. A reference does not establish that processing is lawful."@en .

ens:retentionPolicy a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "retention policy"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:DataExchangeActivity ; rdfs:range prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:comment "Reference to the approved retention schedule or policy applicable to this exchange."@en .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# PART 2 – Matching anchors, built on rc.3 terms
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

## 2.1 TEL TSI messages (reused as-is from the rc.3 telematics module)
##   Composition, 2.5.1(16):
##     era:TrainCompositionMessage
##       -> era:trainCompositionJourneySection -> era:TrainCompositionJourneySection
##          (subclass of era:LocoIdent: era:locoNumber = EVN of the traction
##           unit, era:regenerativeBrake, era:tractionType)
##       -> era:trainRunningData -> era:TrainRunningData
##       -> era:trainRunningTechData -> era:TrainRunningTechData
##          (era:trainWeight = total train mass, xsd:int, no unit declared)
##       message time: era:messageHeader -> era:messageDateTimeCreated
##   Running information, 2.5.2(8):
##     era:TrainRunningInformationMessage -> era:trainLocationReport
##       -> era:TrainLocationReport (era:location -> era:PrimaryLocation,
##          era:locationDateTime); era:responsibleRU (xsd:string)
##   Gap to raise with ERA: rc.3 holds the EVN only as a string
##   (era:locoNumber), with no object link to era:Vehicle. Hence
##   ens:tractionUnitVehicle below.

ens:tractionUnitVehicle a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "traction unit vehicle"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule enssh:TractionUnitVehicleShape ;
    rdfs:domain era:LocoIdent ;
    rdfs:range era:Vehicle ;
    rdfs:comment "Resolves the era:locoNumber source string to a registered vehicle only after the documented EVN normalization and validation rule succeeds."@en .

ens:matchedComposition a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "matched composition"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ;
    rdfs:range era:TrainCompositionMessage ;
    rdfs:comment "Composition message used as allocation evidence; preserve journey-section detail in the source message."@en .

ens:matchedRunningInformation a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "matched running information"@en ;
    skos:definition "Running information message used as evidence for the allocation."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyAllocation ;
    rdfs:range era:TrainRunningInformationMessage .

ens:exchangeContains a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "exchange contains"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:SettlementSystem ;
    rdfs:range ens:DataExchangeActivity ;
    rdfs:comment "Exchange activity received by this settlement system; unlike a message annotation, this is an auditable receipt event."@en .

## 2.2 Borders and zones (reuse RINF topology)

ens:delimitedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "delimited by"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:SettlementZone ;
    rdfs:range era:ReferenceBorderPoint ;
    rdfs:comment "Border points that delimit the zone. Operational points reach them through era:referenceBorderPoint; their identifier is era:borderPointId (to be matched with IRS 90930 border point lists)."@en .

ens:zoneCountry a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "zone country"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:SettlementZone ; rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:comment "Same country scheme as the range of era:inCountry."@en .

## 2.3 Grid context (reuse RINF energy parameters)

ens:readingOnTrack a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "reading on track"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/dy6/def/energy/> ;
    vs:term_status "unstable" ;
    rdfs:domain ens:EnergyReading ;
    rdfs:range era:RunningTrack ;
    rdfs:comment "Map-matched from the GPS fix. Then era:contactLineSystem -> era:ContactLineSystem gives era:energySupplySystem (voltage and frequency) and era:maxTrainCurrent."@en .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# PART 3 – Reused classes and properties
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Minimal declarations of the external classes this extension uses, so
# that they are typed and labelled when this file is loaded on its own
# (rc.3 uses no owl:imports either). Labels are copied from the source
# vocabularies: ERA v4.0.0-rc.3 and W3C SOSA/SSN/SSN-Ext (vendored), PROV-O,
# OWL-Time and QUDT. Their definitions stay with their publishers.

## 3.1 ERA ontology v4.0.0-rc.3

era:Body a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Body"@en .
era:Feature a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "ERA Feature"@en .
era:LocoIdent a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Loco ident"@en .
era:OrganisationRole a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Organisation Role"@en .
era:ReferenceBorderPoint a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Reference border point"@en .
era:RunningTrack a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Running track"@en .
era:OperationalTrainNumberIdentifier a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Operational train number identifier"@en .
era:TrainCompositionJourneySection a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Train composition journey section"@en .
era:TrainCompositionMessage a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Train composition message"@en .
era:TrainIdent a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Train ident"@en .
era:TrainRunningInformationMessage a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Train running information message"@en .
era:Vehicle a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Vehicle"@en .

## 3.2 W3C SOSA, SSN and SSN-Ext

sosa:FeatureOfInterest a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Feature Of Interest"@en .
sosa:ObservableProperty a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Observable Property"@en .
sosa:Observation a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Observation"@en .
sosa:ObservationCollection a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Collection of observations"@en .
sosa:Platform a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Platform"@en .
sosa:Sensor a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Sensor"@en .
ssn:System a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "System"@en .

## 3.3 Other W3C, OGC and ETSI vocabularies

prov:Activity a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Activity"@en .
prov:Entity a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Entity"@en .
time:Interval a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Time interval"@en .
geo:Feature a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Feature"@en .
qudt:QuantityValue a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Quantity value"@en .
saref:Meter a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Meter"@en .
skos:Concept a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Concept"@en .

## 3.4 Reused properties and annotation properties

era:operationalTrainNumber a owl:DatatypeProperty .
era:trainDepartureDate a owl:DatatypeProperty .
era:organisationCode a owl:DatatypeProperty .
era:roleOf a owl:ObjectProperty .
era:hasOrganisationRole a owl:ObjectProperty .
era:unitOfMeasure a owl:AnnotationProperty .
era:shaclShapeValidationRule a owl:AnnotationProperty .
skos:definition a owl:AnnotationProperty .
vs:term_status a owl:AnnotationProperty .
